Package: nimo-control-center
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Andycodeman <188934395+Andycodeman@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: dkms, linux-headers-generic | linux-headers, libc6 (>= 2.39), libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0, kmod, udev, passwd, login
Recommends: power-profiles-daemon, mokutil, wireplumber
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Andycodeman/nimo-axis-linux-fixes
Description: Linux driver and Control Center for the NIMO AXIS 395 (N161L)
 The nimo-wmi kernel driver (built with DKMS) and NIMO Control Center, a Linux
 version of NIMO's Windows app: 4-zone keyboard RGB, side light bars, 9 lighting
 effects, keyboard sleep timer, Win/Fn/PrtSc key switches, fan speeds, battery
 charge limit and power modes (also in the desktop's power menu), with a tray
 icon and your own lighting presets.
 .
 The driver only loads on the NIMO AXIS 395 (N161L).
